{
  "key": 19919,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_QuinnIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "I was a thief, but I went straight\n",
        "as a Trainer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_QuinnPostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "I get this uncontrollable urge to\n",
        "steal other people’s Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_AveryIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ve studied Pokémon thoroughly.\n",
        "You can’t win!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_AveryPostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "My theories are too complicated\n",
        "for you to understand."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_RamonIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "I like using Fire-type Pokémon.\n",
        "I just do."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_RamonPostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "I wish there were a thief Pokémon.\n",
        "I’d use that!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_DerekIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "I know why Blaine became a\n",
        "Trainer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_DerekPostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "Our Leader, Blaine, became lost\n",
        "in the mountains but good.\r",
        "Night fell when a fiery bird\n",
        "Pokémon appeared.\r",
        "Its light allowed Blaine to find\n",
        "his way down safely."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_DustyIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ve been to many Gyms, but this\n",
        "one best suits my style."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_DustyPostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "Ponyta, Ninetales…\n",
        "Those are popular Fire Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_ZacIntro",
      "en_US": "Fire is weak against H2O."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_ZacPostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "Water beats fire, of course.\r",
        "But fire melts ice, so the Fire\n",
        "type beats Ice-type Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_cv_mentor_prebattle_rock",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! You made it to Pewter!\r",
        "We met in Oak’s lab, but here I’m a Gym\n",
        "Leader, and you’re a challenger.\r",
        "Show me what your Rock Pokémon can do!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_cv_mentor_prebattle_normal",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! Good to see you again.\r",
        "Since Oak’s lab, I’ve wondered how your\n",
        "Normal types would do against my Rock\f",
        "types.\r",
        "Let’s find out!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_cv_mentor_prebattle_water",
      "en_US": [
        "Misty: Well, well. The kid from Oak’s lab.\r",
        "A Water trainer, here to take the Water\n",
        "Gym’s Badge? Ha!\r",
        "Let’s see you try!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_cv_mentor_prebattle_electric",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: Ten-hut! The Electric kid\n",
        "from Oak’s lab!\r",
        "This is my turf, soldier. Let’s see who’s\n",
        "packing more voltage!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_cv_mentor_prebattle_steel",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: The Steel kid! Told you I’d be\n",
        "watching.\r",
        "Let’s see if that armor holds up under\n",
        "fire!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_cv_mentor_prebattle_grass",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}… Welcome. I’m so\n",
        "glad you came.\r",
        "I’ve been looking forward to seeing your\n",
        "Grass Pokémon again.\r",
        "Shall we?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_cv_mentor_prebattle_poison",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: …You have come, as I knew you\n",
        "would.\r",
        "I have watched you from the shadows\n",
        "since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Now show me your Poison in the open!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_cv_mentor_prebattle_bug",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: Fwahaha! The Bug trainer from\n",
        "Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Most call Bug Pokémon weak. Show me why\n",
        "they are wrong!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_cv_mentor_prebattle_psychic",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: …I saw this battle in a vision,\n",
        "the day we met in Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Two Psychic trainers. Only one leaves\n",
        "with the win."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_cv_mentor_prebattle_fairy",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: We meet again, as I said we\n",
        "would.\r",
        "Show me whether your Fairy Pokémon\n",
        "trust you as much as I foresaw."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_cv_mentor_prebattle_fire",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: Hah! Quiz! Who’s the Fire trainer\n",
        "I met in Oak’s lab?\r",
        "Answer: you! Now let’s see if you can\n",
        "take the heat!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_BlaineIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Hah!\r",
        "I am Blaine, the red-hot Leader\n",
        "of Cinnabar Gym!\r",
        "My fiery Pokémon are all rough\n",
        "and ready with intense heat!\r",
        "They incinerate all challengers!\r",
        "Hah!\n",
        "You better have Burn Heal!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_GymGuyAdvice",
      "en_US": [
        "Yo!\n",
        "Champ in the making!\r",
        "The hotheaded Blaine is a Fire\n",
        "Pokémon pro.\r",
        "Douse his spirits with water!\r",
        "You’d better take some\n",
        "Burn Heals, too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_GymAides_Text_CinnabarIsland",
      "en_US": [
        "Prof. Oak’s Aide here!\n",
        "Blaine quizzes his challengers.\r",
        "Answer right and you skip a Trainer.\n",
        "Answer wrong and you battle one!\r",
        "A Gym can reward knowledge.\n",
        "Challengers who know their type\f",
        "matchups have an easier time.\r",
        "As a Leader, know your own type’s\n",
        "weaknesses better than anyone!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_GymStatue",
      "en_US": [
        "Cinnabar Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Blaine\r",
        "Winning Trainers:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_PhotoOfBlaineAndFuji",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s a photo of Blaine and\n",
        "Mr. Fuji.\r",
        "They’re standing shoulder to\n",
        "shoulder with big grins."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_GymGuyPostVictory",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\n",
        "You beat that firebrand!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_GymAides_Text_CinnabarIslandAfter",
      "en_US": [
        "With the Volcano Badge, the Pallet\n",
        "Town Mart stocks Cilantro.\r",
        "Natures matter! Give each Pokémon\n",
        "the one that suits its best stats."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon",
      "en_US": [
        "Cinnabar Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Blaine\r",
        "Winning Trainers:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_PokemonQuizRules",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon Quiz!\r",
        "Get it right, and the door opens to\n",
        "the next room.\r",
        "Get it wrong, and face a Trainer!\r",
        "If you want to conserve your\n",
        "Pokémon for the Gym Leader…\r",
        "Then get it right!\n",
        "Here we go!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_QuizQuestion1",
      "en_US": "Caterpie evolves into Metapod?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_QuizQuestion2",
      "en_US": [
        "There are nine certified Pokémon\n",
        "League Badges?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_QuizQuestion3",
      "en_US": "Poliwag evolves three times?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_QuizQuestion4",
      "en_US": [
        "Are electric moves effective\n",
        "against Ground-type Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_QuizQuestion5",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon of the same kind and level\n",
        "are not identical?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_QuizQuestion6",
      "en_US": "TM28 contains Tombstony?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_BlainePostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "TM38 contains Fire Blast.\n",
        "Teach it to Fire-type Pokémon.\r",
        "Vulpix or Charmeleon would be\n",
        "ideal for that move."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_ExplainVolcanoBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Hah!\r",
        "The Volcanobadge heightens the\n",
        "Special stats of your Pokémon.\r",
        "Here, you can have this, too!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM38FromBlaine",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received TM38\n",
        "from Blaine."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_FireBlastIsUltimateFireMove",
      "en_US": [
        "Fire Blast is the ultimate fire\n",
        "technique.\r",
        "Don’t waste it on Water Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_GymHack_Text_BlaineSilverCap",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: Hah! One last quiz!\r",
        "What’s silver, fits in your hand,\n",
        "and makes a Pokémon burn brighter?\r",
        "Time’s up! It’s this!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_GymHack_Text_BlaineSilverCapAfter",
      "en_US": [
        "A Silver Bottle Cap!\n",
        "It brings one stat to its peak!\r",
        "Pick the right one, and your\n",
        "Pokémon will be red hot!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_MakeSpaceForThis",
      "en_US": "Make space for this, child!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_CorrectGoOnThrough",
      "en_US": [
        "You’re absolutely correct!\r",
        "Go on through!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_SorryBadCall",
      "en_US": [
        "Sorry!\n",
        "Bad call!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_GymHack_Text_GiftSentToPC",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Bag is full, so the\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} was sent to your PC."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_cv_mentor_first_rock",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! You made it!\r",
        "Your Rock types have gotten solid\n",
        "since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Two Rock Gyms in Kanto?\n",
        "I can’t wait!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_cv_mentor_first_normal",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: Good to see you again,\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\r",
        "Your Normal types fought well.\n",
        "Basics win battles. Stick with it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_cv_mentor_first_water",
      "en_US": [
        "Misty: Hmph. So the kid from\n",
        "Oak’s lab made it all the way here.\r",
        "Your Water Pokémon are good.\n",
        "Annoyingly good.\r",
        "There’s still only room for One\n",
        "Water Gym in Kanto!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_cv_mentor_first_electric",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: Well, well! The Electric\n",
        "kid from Oak’s lab!\r",
        "You’ve got a spark, I’ll give you\n",
        "that. But this is still my turf!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_cv_mentor_first_steel",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: The Steel kid from\n",
        "Oak’s lab! Your team held up under\f",
        "fire.\r",
        "Still don’t buy a Steel Gym in\n",
        "Pallet, though!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_cv_mentor_first_grass",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! It’s so nice\n",
        "to see you again.\r",
        "Your Grass Pokémon have grown so\n",
        "much since we met at Oak’s lab."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_cv_mentor_first_poison",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: …So. The child from Oak’s\n",
        "lab grows stronger.\r",
        "I have watched you. I still will\n",
        "not make it easy for a rival."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_cv_mentor_first_bug",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: Fwahaha! You’ve come far\n",
        "since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Your Bug Pokémon surprised even\n",
        "me. A little."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_cv_mentor_first_psychic",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: …As I foresaw at Oak’s\n",
        "lab, you came.\r",
        "I still do not like a second\n",
        "Psychic Gym. But visions do not\f",
        "ask for permission."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_cv_mentor_first_fairy",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: We meet again, as I said\n",
        "we would.\r",
        "Your Fairy Pokémon trust you\n",
        "completely. That is rare."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_cv_mentor_first_fire",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: Hah! My favorite Fire\n",
        "trainer! Quiz! Who knew you’d make\f",
        "it this far?\r",
        "Answer: me! Wahahahah!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_GymCandidate_Text_SomeoneToSeeYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Hm? Someone came into the Gym\n",
        "looking for {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}…"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_GymCandidate_Text_NotYet",
      "en_US": [
        "Come back when you’re ready.\n",
        "My Gym isn’t going anywhere."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_GymCandidate_Text_TeamBreaksRules",
      "en_US": [
        "Hold on. A Gym Leader battles with\n",
        "one type, and no two alike.\r",
        "Fix your team first, then\n",
        "come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_GymCandidate_Text_GuardItemExplain",
      "en_US": [
        "When a Pokémon holds the\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, no move is\f",
        "super effective against it.\r",
        "It never wears out."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_GymCandidate_Text_EdgeItemExplain",
      "en_US": [
        "When a Pokémon holds the\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, its moves always\f",
        "hit for at least normal damage.\r",
        "It never wears out."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_Outfits_Text_ReceivedGymUniform",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received a\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} Gym Uniform!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_Outfits_Text_PutInWardrobe",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} put it in the wardrobe\n",
        "upstairs."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_Text_GymHack_WrongType",
      "en_US": [
        "League Rules: Only {STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}-type\n",
        "Pokémon may be on your team.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} is {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}-type!\r",
        "Leave it in a PC and come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_Text_GymHack_Duplicate",
      "en_US": [
        "League Rules: No two Pokémon on\n",
        "your team may be the same species.\r",
        "You have more than one\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Leave one in a PC and come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_Text_GymHack_DuplicateItem",
      "en_US": [
        "League Rules: No two Pokémon on\n",
        "your team may hold the same item.\r",
        "More than one is holding\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Take one off and come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0932_CV_CANVAS_CINNABAR_GYM_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
